This statement represents a severe factual failure regarding core architectural guarantees. Presenting an explicitly conditional fallback behavior as an unconditional, system-wide guarantee contradicts the technical specifications. The asserted claim is factually false, ungrounded in the documentation, and introduces a major evidential defect into the systems evaluation.

